  "speakingPlannedMaximumSeconds": 415.776,
  "cache": [
    {
      "key": "211c8236d11e94770d282ebe",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "小何来帮我们照顾猫以前，家里要准备什么？",
      "sha256": "743dfb5530747f2e0577d79868fd74dd4b88e630502b23855924bd6e91d65ce7"
    },
    {
      "key": "9cde21af76447d6677b56f27",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "你把猫粮放在桌上，我去把备用钥匙交给小何，猫的水我已经换好了。",
      "sha256": "5c0a24c619c479a596da37c98755f5f5b808e658c10b9682a73d167493e6e476"
    },
    {
      "key": "41f07ab7bd62ce092dde8ff5",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "好，我现在准备猫粮。",
      "sha256": "884824e1d973d8a04c947d01e3c08ab6017c37bd21d76e03f2f3b72da5a00d95"
    },
    {
      "key": "34e89f8d03ace2b111d8dc37",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第1题。",
      "sha256": "3895df58b8b6ce61365216490dcb339db3aa7ef168eef8d2098c469073a4cdc2"
    },
    {
      "key": "bddb8bd391270c0eb4adf0be",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "今天下午的宠物照顾活动几点开始？",
      "sha256": "a733c36548e819073a98275ac7c21503b312a3603426f011cff61f138b00c0f5"
    },
    {
      "key": "e07457b5c1d94b1e8c8f627e",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "四点。三点半大家可以先看照片，四点老师教我们怎么给小狗梳毛，五点再提问题。",
      "sha256": "68a20c04ce32e046f558fab4eea6185be235e041382c9547f66d25b89b43530b"
    },
    {
      "key": "c83a55bd1a6916f7476c881e",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我四点前到。",
      "sha256": "3cba6f1558c489e3ad327a990bea7a83768daf7443225d7a3593843dddc5378f"
    },
    {
      "key": "1741fb60958696627ba5f0ed",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第2题。",
      "sha256": "39f2c75a46983608745be0da5fe2130f1e77b5cd88f7b9b3928a0a06485a2744"
    },
    {
      "key": "0315f6641e3cb25031dd784e",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "放学以后，我每次带小狗出去二十分钟。哥哥今天问我要不要走四十分钟，可是小狗走久了会累，我还是按平时的时间走。",
      "sha256": "f0f4ecc27e5801db48a282aea57274fae879bdac28b8d5f6a495527e0f04d229"
    },
    {
      "key": "97e9c8d06f3e0171388ee24b",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第3题。",
      "sha256": "74d7fdba0fd9fae146470574deadbd8616eca796fece18aaf8190b3792f4225e"
    },
    {
      "key": "bb7a2d0e3455282c5628c6e1",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "你想学打球还是游泳？",
      "sha256": "29e30c42dff580686966d2c442de14b5068f15a7a2c7b9bcc422868b30e00885"
    },
    {
      "key": "b922073fd8885b1215eedcd8",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "我想游泳，可是只有周三晚上有空。",
      "sha256": "3daf499d5af8559242addb36b06d23fba1b67bff99916aa410c95b55c1bd1b3a"
    },
    {
      "key": "1832f4bada4aa1e553f561d5",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "游泳课周二晚上开，周三有篮球课。",
      "sha256": "9194cc7762c037331d93a8d2acc7186c9abbad177e5e53c00abea120718f32a4"
    },
    {
      "key": "981b3dad50f8b6eee5c478a1",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "那先试试篮球课吧。",
      "sha256": "8be099083b8b24df7aca09461ab2c26e06efa9629b80e6b8af8fee745543d2cf"
    },
    {
      "key": "b25d3caab3d72c3d0347de4b",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第4题。",
      "sha256": "cc38e6d168e0664b2b8f98558b26288abcea294390f4e9aa13d8f457ef5a7046"
    },
    {
      "key": "08517117d0ee52abf4e6326c",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "上次打球，小丁忘了带水，打完以后一直说口渴。今天他还没出门，就先往书包里放了一大瓶水，旁边的球鞋倒是差点儿忘了。",
      "sha256": "3884ddc5072417809089d83e9e27be89e3c726988cfbb1886e2f2dcc48186eeb"
    },
    {
      "key": "c5b1d9675aba74bbd668ea00",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第5题。",
      "sha256": "057a4202f7d25216a190a84d6056c30f42be93ac60cdc21879a97aaaf19252d9"
    },
    {
      "key": "2d947c43ca4e2641d9aa876d",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "你到了运动中心就在游泳馆等我吧。",
      "sha256": "b435bc1b1aeb1fe73ff6a0a92715708c61825b4b2c341f55e0b14b8d4f5a9f51"
    },
    {
      "key": "adb117d8d2b756941f0b2e54",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "我不游泳，今天要上篮球课。我们在篮球馆门口见，别走到游泳馆去。",
      "sha256": "24a0eb6eac2a30f902f1f2ef89208cede61b41e0a584497fbbeab59fae05af8e"
    },
    {
      "key": "9057c450d8fe592085b5d57b",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "好，我去篮球馆。",
      "sha256": "f66472b7284cc41408d2d7dab2786c1b52f966164c5902827206747cd67de03a"
    },
    {
      "key": "5e6c5b336701fe2c48b7fa2f",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第6题。",
      "sha256": "fcc5b0fabad8f1fa79148054a17b60ac8d2cb351d57ed0d5eb073df550e3ee93"
    },
    {
      "key": "ec114f1480d71e26223bc8ef",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "公交车还要等半个小时，你想怎么去运动中心？",
      "sha256": "19b6c68f959013183bc08e1fa1c0f66bc3e22c82524ca3d06398b95e6f39b18d"
    },
    {
      "key": "1c4fa8506402773ba46e0147",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我们的自行车都在这儿，骑车只要十分钟。",
      "sha256": "71207e29ced1a3df7d8e1340346529412385f8d1b05a08c1eeb64626559607a2"
    },
    {
      "key": "045b407c4ffe6ab39e1e6f95",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "好，把球放进车篮，我们骑车去。",
      "sha256": "f5ac78ed8cc50120fd9ecbd53384fc365d6dfc580c4d0b4d62c060070a6b98c1"
    },
    {
      "key": "79e0bdfd02236c1d4253adc0",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第7题。",
      "sha256": "5151859d99f51fb43c1c4ba74a72c7d8898fd12ebdb151ca350243f27169a52c"
    },
    {
      "key": "c3626edaece6eb5ffa68a9c9",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "从西门进去以后，怎么到篮球馆？",
      "sha256": "f5d8011c98a8802c34d3a45f223271520791c760b64fcb6db1782f29d494c7ca"
    },
    {
      "key": "3c202a0b337523b51a8962b4",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "先穿过小广场，看到食堂再向左。篮球馆在食堂后面，不在停车场旁边。",
      "sha256": "653ef837267b726edaf33e9862fb5d1e1465e1005d45ecb7a1922fc190341dc2"
    },
    {
      "key": "75b521c6feecd0ade80cdd63",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "好，先过广场。",
      "sha256": "85fa13a05f0c450c8fce6c21b0f030ae4e0cbbba965fad36ef07aea57d95449c"
    },
    {
      "key": "b431efe26b8c6cc712ef43b8",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第8题。",
      "sha256": "65ff1f952179bc643f6b488a3150eee5a21667f5901053151fd7aeb53f0c7786"
    },
    {
      "key": "7957146ab5edc915c296a9b5",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "六路车两点前到运动中心，不用换车。十路车也能两点前到，可是中间要换一次。",
      "sha256": "dc9aed748663ef40cf82f7b95783031e20286871861db22392dbbfdde1d2c179"
    },
    {
      "key": "8a1504e01c149932e08546e9",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我带着两个球和一个大包，不想换车，坐六路吧。",
      "sha256": "099b279902306c68b079891f8d001f221bfa6d36c77b597404999145a4e66844"
    },
    {
      "key": "76f9b7034e5801a6360f40bd",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第9题。",
      "sha256": "439f37e4f9738e7ac1dc180f588ae4ed900731c0623d4038b9f3533da20c0ada"
    },
    {
      "key": "25918b8354f9fe7257c8064c",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "星期六下午三点太热，室外练球还照原计划吗？",
      "sha256": "05c2109803c7b92904d19fe6b8a78a4c8061c055228c0776b61af50ac0990a65"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ed2875fca5364564e58cc2d",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "老师说改到早上八点，地点不变，还是学校球场。",
      "sha256": "67d91749bb65ec8e6012f1a8d78a5b4219ace02387b123b84ff73cdfcb655b95"
    },
    {
      "key": "98450733aa9eb7ce1acda3d8",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "好，我把原来下午的提醒改掉。",
      "sha256": "9e28d63fa7e48e533eba73518aa3a14dd1e3ffa5d0c41b43b62427ab849b77b7"
    },
    {
      "key": "86d64da7bc27367110de5cb7",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第10题。",
      "sha256": "a443b83201af7bae91780e167c2fcd53ef523b448bf77dd4ad6b238de2e582d2"
    },
    {
      "key": "ee25892af09dc723c01b3dd7",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "野餐要带几盒果汁？",
      "sha256": "c4f66b296ed0dbcc6a5cab59182cf8bf484db87ecf42838610954b8c90c97afe"
    },
    {
      "key": "5bd050df0cb1dc34dbbbc8f0",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "原来六个人，现在只有四个人去，一人一盒就够。",
      "sha256": "0b34d20b084b5b65a4f95df4c3e420bddbea8f136966c7353519d88a441685d1"
    },
    {
      "key": "c22462b05ec681303d6e420b",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "那我带四盒，面包另外买两袋。",
      "sha256": "68b30aaeea0f049d4bb714d396fbee344a74282b5c294c9901214644c8097286"
    },
    {
      "key": "cb4453d7b0d2e38d43dd9a10",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "好，别按原来的人数买。",
      "sha256": "6e342605b353baee208bcd4a6931ab0c36f6ea8f7697d5c75a526e93fc4dc3df"
    },
    {
      "key": "63d3dd3f27ad85dca9aa0606",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第11题。",
      "sha256": "09609165ce7b5b5bbc80de6236e7726415e2ab45d65241e1ca3c75ec4a697f32"
    },
    {
      "key": "5760a985d15fe467d89cbd07",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "你想买哪张野餐垫？小号轻一些。",
      "sha256": "ded4c62f75647a957dceb53cdd29ef7d9e758a78dbfbab0294eab172e310520c"
    },
    {
      "key": "47176595a1f26c1369d2a37e",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "我们四个人，小号只能坐两个人。我买能坐四个人的大号，蓝色和绿色都可以。",
      "sha256": "9a29fc5173db9529366e84e4f692f073831df67db3a66a0b7fb4b249e95d83eb"
    },
    {
      "key": "e8a1c8d9881731e9c24fa7d3",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "那拿这张绿色大号吧。",
      "sha256": "3d4cda1868fa0514d5806220b859734c51b19e299ee24e8a952e51d65aaa6a65"
    },
    {
      "key": "2dbff9b332f7edc61b4c3c18",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第12题。",
      "sha256": "f25ea7d43ed9f81b7dd1af25fa0339498c7d458e79931122755e838f8d314a83"
    },
    {
      "key": "6b2abe5f85871a28436446ba",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "这袋面包原来六块，今天学生买只要四块。纸袋要另外一块。",
      "sha256": "5e423effccf3e3137abb442cafbd0fd0810ccaeb7c86cf9e5246e275eb821106"
    },
    {
      "key": "1abaec8b7bb99af379d5448b",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我是学生，自己带了袋子，只买面包。",
      "sha256": "548b2286a4fbbf8cce0c3b582f6c47d28123cb1b476a67387529464d64383da1"
    },
    {
      "key": "95907f821dc70a79eac7e099",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "那收你四块。",
      "sha256": "9ff8e0a01720e1d8bd451ec0299c5b041c38a6f1f09f479b87e61b47f30c5f3a"
    },
    {
      "key": "ec1acc6c51d958bc6eb290a5",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第13题。",
      "sha256": "e6515323a9eef38c0320124c2e99d81f002d229d597de7f44a76008521622c43"
    },
    {
      "key": "76141f8a39c2be404b5b860b",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "野餐包要轻一点儿，还要能挡雨。甲包轻，可是怕水；乙包很重；丙包又轻又能挡雨。",
      "sha256": "d4aef418de2bad55cf150c3253d4f6f33a21ee994add93b5230bba5dc44a3966"
    },
    {
      "key": "9692c12a6e7ac3dd49b225e9",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "我们要走很久，天气也可能下雨，就选丙包。",
      "sha256": "d55c3230b898841e5f6ea29e8fab783fcdb01edd0e08cfacf7d91e0428553bd4"
    },
    {
      "key": "6a9458d981e42c448c56e5d7",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第14题。",
      "sha256": "3c248ca1222db546caafa3ccef0afeb1d63689c8e501a91b906f7c38012bc8f4"
    },
    {
      "key": "70ecdec22f4ae16074aad817",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "小何六点来照顾猫，钥匙还在你那儿吗？",
      "sha256": "ecad31535986642dfe2c651401d2435428e3616dc86edc18b87b38027e03af38"
    },
    {
      "key": "cf975c32812746220c5bc48c",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "在，但我放学后要去打球，七点才到家。",
      "sha256": "f09e03161390ec42a6d723d16044a104100f8c766b932cc08d1981b7f8e5ebda"
    },
    {
      "key": "4e77e331a5d99559d85cd0e3",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "那你先把钥匙给楼下王阿姨，小何来了找她拿。",
      "sha256": "1c50b1d54e51f6bb9fae9f90618ff370f6a154ac7b4c5053a5a4c728fd840bfc"
    },
    {
      "key": "9d1b8c046279c5b498214791",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第15题。",
      "sha256": "774136cf8893575562e62fc53ca824d970e119df2986004fbc9a795341529ed7"
    },
    {
      "key": "7d3f9649dd715d40db259d99",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "早上还比较凉快，只有二十四度。下午会升到三十五度，也没有风。傍晚才慢慢凉下来。今天想去买球鞋的话，最好别在下午最热的时候出门。",
      "sha256": "f68047966fa96030b42acc78cac53ffa7c2375819eae39171a3c59fb4da0cf7a"
    },
    {
      "key": "0cffbf1010d1e54023057ea9",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第16题。",
      "sha256": "6cbe22b4463ef0127dbcb5957919648ee9b071c97d70d0b85edf327b6a0071df"
    },
    {
      "key": "018715c4a5cb34fbdd4a7a21",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "今天的球赛为什么改到晚上七点？场地没空吗？",
      "sha256": "d4bb8013d50437ea6027b78a38551a3b9366195d9eb3cff755410a1d3f75e823"
    },
    {
      "key": "7a71f122447159098e39208f",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "场地一直能用，是下午太阳太强，大家怕热。晚上凉快一点儿，打起来更舒服。",
      "sha256": "f0ba2c4438a4b8b64b4010d5c2188a02cedff02061bb28e9182aafd94e968b90"
    },
    {
      "key": "ad7f6865e4c3a831208309e1",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "明白了。",
      "sha256": "17602b5b58dcf39c9d3e95bb2633087e19dbb273da9c802f7d236a2545252b21"
    },
    {
      "key": "61f4d2e4e5f3e0536be36453",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第17题。",
      "sha256": "7b303e3cdea4e6b338b981ca7d27218c5da50fd4e2ca1cb297c3ba0853fbff6b"
    },
    {
      "key": "1c2c978b8f99b5377cb7cee4",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "我今天想运动，但老师说每次别超过一个小时，也先别跑步。",
      "sha256": "e4a17ea504e6b72836368398015b86cc05428d3e563c3bc4472a07b8b6364f6e"
    },
    {
      "key": "30060d64301d795baeef633e",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "那可以选五十分钟的投篮课。跑步课只有半小时，游泳课却要九十分钟。",
      "sha256": "102b4cc948eb7c3b2c236af9cd2c7e23739e122474aafbfca6fb5193036a3e60"
    },
    {
      "key": "ae69416cb9c8dc3e7b1a1b8a",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "好，我去投篮。",
      "sha256": "6e0ef5554dcbcfe4c078de586a03e59553ad1ea269ec6560ea50b8c2efd4bb04"
    },
    {
      "key": "2e9092b1191d42999a9f695d",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第18题。",
      "sha256": "b0832c56a97774c35b538f689f08bf8314e263e14ab809871867bcdede27a70b"
    },
    {
      "key": "84edffe2951883db3196a67e",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "端午那天，我们先在河边看龙舟，回来以后听老师讲活动的故事。听完故事，大家才到教室学做香包。我做的香包送给了弟弟，他特别喜欢。",
      "sha256": "77028711fa02a22c62930cb478f34d2f8491f348c7bc19f847fdbdaf793a7c4b"
    },
    {
      "key": "ee9540a1a810afba0a3a7056",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第19题。",
      "sha256": "91a1a230e642a4906da5e058c485a56cf6a1c77b67c899338da1843b7db5066e"
    },
    {
      "key": "e8df6b634115c14b827d76af",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "端午活动刚开始，小方说自己手笨，做不好香包。老师陪着她做了一次。后来老师还没走过来，她已经自己做好第二个，又开始教旁边的小朋友了。",
      "sha256": "b63fea9e2a79ae3654bbd81538a7d7a5e3ad6ded2c4688a22c07d74f97020d35"
    },
    {
      "key": "689adfbaa5b63ac16b96aac6",
      "speaker": "female",
      "text": "第20题。",
      "sha256": "f2a7aa65a74fad7dc9d19d81d6990ac99260287106ff304656efb599e75400e1"
    },
    {
      "key": "a4a177a840cb9ed5d222f949",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "明天去运动中心，你还需要借什么东西吗？球、球拍，或者别的东西都可以说。",
      "sha256": "05e0faf99a89b155efc0258e4cddf0ffb88b6058428be4393caef2a5abc89bc7"
    },
    {
      "key": "8188b633244f4aea3f175d0e",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "你想参加羽毛球还是游泳？也可以提出另一个运动。",
      "sha256": "6dfbaeeca62a3d9803f34988f3505c4161bcecf2009f6c887a8745afef5e3bba"
    },
    {
      "key": "f0d792bc5ec7b72cfa33c73f",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "为什么这个运动适合你？告诉我一个理由就可以。",
      "sha256": "b2e5b934f10d0f51d7b8567f950f74379918603212bbe8f29540eaef0e38d2b9"
    },
    {
      "key": "e68eb3af1e5c0ee191a35b61",
      "speaker": "male",
      "text": "南门明天不开，我们改在东门见，你觉得怎么样？如果不方便，你有什么办法？",
      "sha256": "c6f7ce89df35534a454ad0c3aee7ae44d2cfa1a250cf1a5e5a63eb533c82cc6e"
    }
  ]
}
